                <pb facs="0719" n="637" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg637"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 417.00/54.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Chargé
                        d’Affaires.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic">July 26,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Department agrees to postponement of modifications of decree as outlined in
                    Department’s June 26, in accordance with your July 20.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
